        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Stonewyrm is truly massive. The entire battle arena is encircled by the Stonewyrm's coils. </p><p>Players can only target the head of the beast (its token). </p><p>The Stonewyrm is immune to forced movement and cannot be knocked Prone. </p><p>The Stonewyrm's head cannot move, and stays at its position on the north end of the arena.</p>"
        },
