        "category": null,
        "deathNote": true,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger </strong>The Stonewyrm would die.</p><p><strong>Effect </strong>The Maw refuses to let its vessel die. Do the following.</p><ul><li><p>Set the Stonewyrm to 1 hp and apply the @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.thPuoO4lUmH8v63g]{Maw Frenzy (T4)} effect. The Stonewyrm gains buffs and abilities as noted in the effect.</p></li><li><p>Every creature in the arena is exposed to @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-actors.Actor.GYh6QcGiPpdxLb76.Item.sq9MApGhtk78pp5P]{Curse of Decay} (or @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-actors.Actor.GYh6QcGiPpdxLb76.Item.dKhBkulE7hkDaBOI]{Modification: Curse of Greater Decay}, if that modification is in effect).</p></li><li><p>Describe how the enchantments on @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-actors.Actor.PWGNOSjOBcIt2Qvv]{The Den Mother (T4)} drill whirr to life, recovering from the initial push through the Stonewyrm's maw-adamantine cocoon. Perform the Den Mother's reaction and add it to the initiative tracker.</p></li><li><p>Add @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.B1qFNjfOX1dACQpL]{Power the Den Mother} to your PC's sheets. Remember to tell the players they <em>must</em> use the drill to kill the Stonewyrm, as it cannot die any other way.</p></li></ul>"
        },
