        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirement </strong>The Stonewyrm must be in a @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.thPuoO4lUmH8v63g]{Maw Frenzy (T4)} (see @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-actors.Actor.GYh6QcGiPpdxLb76.Item.fPtKCeaSkgayfAHA]{Mawtouched Lifeforce})</p><hr /><p>The Stonewyrm makes three Earthen Spike attacks. Apply multiple attack penalty to the Strikes as normal. Creatures hit by these attacks are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} ([[/act escape dc=26]]).</p>"
