        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirement </strong>The Stonewyrm must be in a @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.thPuoO4lUmH8v63g]{Maw Frenzy (T4)} (see @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-actors.Actor.GYh6QcGiPpdxLb76.Item.fPtKCeaSkgayfAHA]{Mawtouched Lifeforce})</p><hr /><p>The Stonewyrm roars, defying death. All creatures in the arena that are not already afflicted by @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.EE6yzIBKSpyYxxTy]{Curse of Decay} (or @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.SRRbA7aR6kOoWtrS]{Curse of Greater Decay}, if that Modification is in play) are exposed again.</p><p>Creatures already afflicted by @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.EE6yzIBKSpyYxxTy]{Curse of Decay} (or @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.SRRbA7aR6kOoWtrS]{Curse of Greater Decay}) must attempt another save immediately, though if they succeed or critically succeed, they do not decrease their stage (just like multiple exposures to a poison).</p>"
        },
        "frequency": {
          "max": 1,
          "per": "round"
        },
