        },
        "actions": {
          "value": 1
        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Stonewyrm calls upon earthen magic, targetting a single magical effect with <strong>a duration and an area</strong>, or an ongoing <strong>magical effect or curse on itself,</strong> and attempts to counteract it.</p><p>Its counteract modifier for this is [[/r 1d20+25 #Resilience of Mountains]]{+25}, and its counteract level is half its creature level, rounded up ([[/r ceil(@actor.level/2)]]).</p>"
        },
