      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
      "name": "Curse of Decay",
      "ownership": {
        "default": 0
      },
      "sort": 400000,
      "system": {
        "_migration": {
          "previous": {
            "foundry": "13.351",
            "schema": 0.954,
            "system": "7.10.1"
          },
          "version": 0.955
        },
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>As the Stonewyrm draws closer to death, its enemies crumble into dust. This curse is activated by the Mawtouched Lifeforce and Death Throes abilties.</p><p><strong>Saving Throw </strong>@Check[will|dc:29]</p><p><strong>Maximum Duration </strong>None, but the curse stops progressing immediatly when the Stonewyrm is killed. After its death, afflicted creatures stay permanently at whatever stage they reached until the curse is removed.</p><p>Use @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.EE6yzIBKSpyYxxTy]{Effect: Curse of Decay} to track the stages of this curse, it will automatically apply and increment the associated conditions.</p><p><strong>Stage 1 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 2 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 3 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 4 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 2} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 5 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 3}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 3}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 3} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 6 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 3}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 3}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 3} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 7 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 4}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 4}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 4} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 8 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 4}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 4}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 4} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 9 </strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 5}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 5}, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 5} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 10 </strong>The creature's flesh crumbles to dust, leaving behind only its gear.</p>"
        },
